<title>USA: Personnel Group CFO Michael Bernard resigns.</title>
<headline>Personnel Group CFO Michael Bernard resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personnel Group of America Inc said Monday that its chief financial officer, Michael Bernard, is resigning December 31 &quot;to pursue other business opportunities.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said Ken Bramlett Jr., senior vice president-administration, general counsel and corporate secretary, will serve as interim chief financial officer until a successor is found.</p>
